#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Forensic decomposition of the frozen real-data micro-auction states.

This study does not search thresholds and does not promote a strategy.  It
replays the exact Candidate-51 continuation and absorption classifiers on their
already-consumed development interval, separates state direction from the
bracket/entry geometry, and measures the cost-aware price space that remained
only after each state was observable.
"""
